   "text": "If you pipe sewage into a tank, you have a treatment plant."
  },
  {
   "role": "problem",
   "text": "But the sludge sinks and piles up on the floor."
  },
  {
   "role": "fix1",
   "text": "So you add a round tank whose arm scrapes it away."
  },
  {
   "role": "name",
   "text": "This is a clarifier, and clean water runs to the river."
  },
  {
